CalldataSliceLib::sliceBytesWithLength
├── given zero length
│   ├── it should return empty bytes
│   └── it should return offset + 32
├── given non-zero length
│   ├── it should return correct bytes slice
│   └── it should return offset + 32 + length
└── given bytes at non-zero offset
    └── it should read length and data from correct position